### mq-proxy REST request examples
### Compatible with JetBrains HTTP Client and VS Code REST Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = cloudtui
@password = changeme
@queue = orders
@messageId = ID:replace-with-actual-id

# ─── Queues ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all queues with stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/queues
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### ─── Messages ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Browse all messages in a queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/queues/{{queue}}/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### Get message detail by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/queues/{{queue}}/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### Send a new message (body is any JSON value — object, array, or string)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/queues/{{queue}}/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "12345",
  "status": "NEW",
  "amount": 99.95
}

### Delete a message by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/queues/{{queue}}/messages/{{messageId}}
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### Move a single message to another queue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/queues/{{queue}}/messages/{{messageId}}/move?to=dlq
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### Move all messages from one queue to another
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/queues/{{queue}}/move?to=archive
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### Purge all messages from a queue
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/queues/{{queue}}/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
